#: ../../language/error_codes/E0080.md:1
msgid "E0080"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0080.md:3
msgid "Warning name: `regex_match_missing_before`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0080.md:5
msgid ""
"A non-streaming `lexscan` pattern can skip an input prefix, but the "
"pattern does not bind or explicitly ignore that prefix."
msgstr "非流式 `lexscan` 模式可以跳过输入前缀，但该模式没有绑定或显式忽略这个前缀。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0080.md:8
msgid ""
"For `String` and `StringView` inputs, an unanchored regex searches "
"forward from the start of the input. Add `^` when the match must start at"
" the beginning, or add `before=` to bind or ignore the skipped prefix."
msgstr ""
"对于 `String` 和 `StringView` 输入，未锚定的正则会从输入开头向后搜索。匹配"
"必须从开头开始时，请添加 `^`；需要绑定或忽略跳过的前缀时，请添加 `before=`。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0080.md:12
msgid "Erroneous example"
msgstr "错误示例"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0080.md:14
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn ends_with_digits(input : String) -> Bool {\n"
"  lexscan input {\n"
"    re\"[0-9]+$\" => true\n"
"    _ => false\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0080.md:18
msgid "Suggestion"
msgstr "建议"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0080.md:20
msgid ""
"Anchor the regex at the start, or make the skipped prefix explicit with "
"`before=prefix` or `before=_`."
msgstr "将正则锚定在开头，或使用 `before=prefix` 或 `before=_` 显式处理跳过的前缀。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0080.md:23
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn ends_with_digits(input : String) -> Bool {\n"
"  lexscan input {\n"
"    (re\"[0-9]+$\", before=_) => true\n"
"    _ => false\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
